   "locked": false,
   "text": "• 54 papers in 2020,\n  131 in 2025\n\n• growth is driven almost\n  entirely by Persian\n\n• Kurdish and Pashto grow\n  modestly; the other\n  varieties stay near zero\n\n• 2026 is partial: the\n  search ended in May",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "• 54 papers in 2020,\n  131 in 2025\n\n• growth is driven almost\n  entirely by Persian\n\n• Kurdish and Pashto grow\n  modestly; the other\n  varieties stay near zero\n\n• 2026 is partial: the\n  search ended in May",
